          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Component links\n**Root:** [System Manager](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=system_manager) → [Scheduler](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=root_scheduler) → [Resource Abstractor](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=root_resource_abstractor&var-compose_service=resource_abstractor) → [Service Manager](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=root_service_manager)\n\n**Cluster:** [Cluster Manager](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=cluster_manager) → [Scheduler](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=cluster_scheduler) → [Resource Abstractor](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=cluster_resource_abstractor) → [Service Manager](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=cluster_service_manager)\n\n**Observability:** [Alloy](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=alloy&var-compose_service=cluster_alloy) · [Loki](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=loki&var-compose_service=cluster_loki) · [Grafana](/d/oakestra-logs/oakestra-orchestrator-logs?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-compose_service=grafana&var-compose_service=cluster_grafana)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.0.0",
      "title": "Quick navigation",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "Loki"
      },
      "description": "LogQL selector and pipeline are built from the dashboard controls. Use the panel menu to open this query in Explore.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "Loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{cluster_id=~\"${cluster_id:regex}\", compose_service=~\"${compose_service:regex}\"} |~ `(?i)(${level_filter:raw})` |~ `(?i)(${search:raw})` ${logql_pipeline:raw}",
          "maxLines": 1000,
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Orchestrator logs — ${cluster_id:text} / ${compose_service:text}",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
